DESCRIPTION:PURCHASE YOUR TICKETS HERE\nMichigan Business Women at Ross pr
 esents the 34th Annual Women in Leadership Conference (WiLC)!\n​Join us 
 for the 2026 WiLC at Michigan Ross on Friday\, October 9\, 2026\, for a da
 y of bold ideas\, candid conversations\, and meaningful connection.\n​Th
 is year’s theme\, Answer the Call\, challenges us to move beyond the tra
 ditional leadership playbook and create space for the conversations that s
 hape women’s lives and careers. From career and family to financial inde
 pendence\, appearance bias\, relationship status\, and coalition building 
 across identities and backgrounds\, WiLC will explore what it truly means 
 to define leadership on your own terms.\n​Through dynamic speakers and c
 onversations spanning finance\, beauty\, fashion\, sports\, media\, and be
 yond\, you’ll hear from women who are challenging expectations\, shaping
  industries\, and creating new paths forward.\n​Come to be inspired. Sta
 y for the conversations. Leave ready to answer your call.\n\nHosted by: Or
 ganizer One Hundred Seven\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https
 ://maizepages.umich.edu/event/12768062
DTEND:20261009T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261009T040316Z
