DESCRIPTION:ISBA Education Session #4: Recruiting Prep: Interviews\, Behavi
 orals\, & Casing Across Different PathsOctober 9 | 4 PM | R2220\nInterview
  prep looks different depending on what you’re recruiting for. Technical
  rounds\, casing\, behaviorals\, each require different preparation. So wh
 at should you actually be working on for your path?\nIn our 4th ISBA Educa
 tion series\, we’ll break down preparation across finance\, consulting\,
  marketing\, product and GM roles\, including technical and quantitative q
 uestions\, case interviews\, online assessments\, take-home assignments\, 
 and behaviorals. We’ll discuss what each format asks of you\, how to str
 ucture your answers\, and how to make practice useful. You’ll hear from
  MBA2s about how they prepared for their specific roles\, which resources 
 helped\, how they practiced with others\, and what they wish they’d star
 ted earlier.Panel:1. Akshat Kishore: Summer Associate - Strategy & Product
 \, Emergence Software Technologies\, Inc. (Financial Services)2. ⁠Anmol 
 Chaudhri: MBA Summer Intern\, OC&C Strategy Consultants (Consulting)3. ⁠
 Kavin Senthil: Brand Marketing Intern\, Danone North America (Consumer Pac
 kaged Goods)4. ⁠Srinath Kausheeka: Technical Product Manager Intern\, eB
 ay Inc. (Technology)\nCome with your questions and leave with a clearer se
 nse of what to prioritize in Fall for your own recruiting path.\n\nHosted 
 by: Organizer Seventy-Six\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https
 ://maizepages.umich.edu/event/12868342
DTEND:20261009T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261009T040316Z
