DESCRIPTION:🍻 The KBC Soju Night you’ve been waiting for is finally he
 re!!\nGet ready for one of the most popular nights at Ross\, KBC Soju Nig
 ht on Oct 9 (Fri)! Come experience a Korean-style pocha (포차) packed w
 ith great food\, drinks\, games\, and Korean vibes.\n🥘 ALL YOU CAN EATK
 orean favorites including Jeyuk Bokkeum (spicy stir-fried pork)\, japchae\
 , fried rice\, kimbap\, Korean fried chicken\, and more!\n🍶 ALL YOU CAN
  DRINKSoju\, beer\, somaek (soju + beer)\, and more! plus\, classic Korean
  drinking games to complete the experience.\n🎟️ Tickets$25 — KBC Me
 mbers (paid members only)$35 — Non-Members\nZelle: 734-555-0102 (Korea B
 usiness Club)\nPlease make your payment by 10/4 (Sunday) 23:59 PM EST to
  secure your spot. After the deadline\, remaining spots will be offered to
  the waitlist.(Walk-ins are not allowed\; wristbands will be required for 
 entry. Wristband pick-up will be announced)\n🚨 ONLY 100 SPOTS AVAILABLE
 !Once we hit capacity\, all additional sign-ups will be waitlisted\, so gr
 ab your ticket early!\nMBA2s: You know what's up or You’ve heard people
  talk about it\, now it’s your turn to experience it. 🍻\nMBA1s: This
  is the event you don't want to miss. Trust me.\nCome hungry. Come thirsty
 . Come ready for a night to remember.\nSee you at Soju Night! 건배! 🍻
 \n\nHosted by: Organizer Eighty-Six\n\nAdditional Information can be found
  at: https://maizepages.umich.edu/event/12820964
