CATEGORIES:Arts
DESCRIPTION:Register here!  Explore solo jazz dancing in this four week 
 series with Sarah Beth! Each week students will learn a new set of classi
 c jazz steps\, a short sequence to solidify their learning\, and engage i
 n solo social dancing. Regardless of your swing dancing experience level\,
  there will be something new for everyone! No solo jazz experience requir
 ed. Attendees who have experience in solo jazz will have the opportunity t
 o try new variations and explore new concepts with their dancing. Classes
  are progressive but since this series is not partnered\, students may mis
 s classes and rejoin later in the series.\n \nWhen:Sundays 7-9pm\, Sept 
 13\, 20 Oct 11\, 18Classes are progressive but since this series is not pa
 rtnered\, students may miss classes and rejoin later in the series.Where:H
 oover St Studio\, 323 E Hoover Ave\, Ann Arbor MI\nInstructor Bio:Sarah Be
 th (SB) is a dancer\, teacher\, choreographer\, and performer based in Gra
 nd Rapids\, MI. She was introduced to Lindy Hop and vernacular jazz over a
  decade ago and hasn't stopped groovin' since. She was invited to join the
  Lindy Focus Residency Program in 2025 and holds competitive titles at eve
 nts such as Second City Swingout\, Dayton Swing Smackdown\, and more. SB i
 s a co-founder of Rapid Rhythms Swing Dance Community\, where she teaches 
 weekly classes and coaches performance and competitive teams. \nSB firmly
  believes dancing is for everybody and every body. Her classes are known f
 or being lively\, interactive\, and adaptive to her students.\nPricing:Pay
 -What-You-Can $10-30 per week*If cost is a barrier to you\, please reach o
 ut to organizer@example.edu to discuss scholarship opportunities. We want 
 everyone to be able to dance!Paypal organizer@example.edum or bring cash o
 r check to class - please arrive early to pay! Register here!  \n\nHost
 ed by: Organizer One Hundred Fifty-Six\n\nAdditional Information can be fo
 und at: https://maizepages.umich.edu/event/12750174
DTEND:20261012T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261009T040316Z
DTSTART:20261011T230000Z
