DESCRIPTION:"Ninpo is the essence of goshinjutsu (self-protection)."\n \
 nDuring the Fall 2026 semester\, Bujinkan Budo Club training will be held
  on Thursdays from 19:00 - 21:00 (7-9pm) at the Intramural Sports Building
  (IMSB) in Room MPR B. If you are interested in trying out a class\, pleas
 e send a message through Maize Pages or an email to organizer13@example.e
 du. Beginners welcome\; we train with people across all levels of experien
 ce!\n \n- Learn self defense and physical coordination through Bujinkan t
 aijiutsu (unarmed combat)\;- Training at the Michigan Bujinkan Dojo is su
 pportive and non-competitive\, emphasizing relaxed but spirited and discip
 lined practice\;- Receive mentoring through the senpai/kohai (senior/junio
 r) relationships fostered in the dojo.\n \nWhat to bring: comfortable wor
 kout clothes\, socks\, and a water bottle!\n-----\nFor more information\,
  email us at organizer@example.edu or checkout our website (www.michi
 ganbujinkan.com)\, which also includes a training schedule!\n\nHosted by:
  Organizer Fifteen\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://maiz
 epages.umich.edu/event/12542887
